upstream: https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/~csk/heesch/  (Craig S. Kaplan, "Heesch
  Numbers of Unmarked Polyforms", arXiv:2105.09438, Contributions to Discrete
  Mathematics 2022). Data files published alongside the paper.
role: the complete per-size non-tiler lists (`*_0up.txt`) are the census that
  decides TILER / NON_TILER for every hole-free polyomino n<=10, polyhex n<=8
  and polyiamond n<=12 (heesch_verify/known_nontilers.json). Files listing
  only Hc>=2 / Hc>=3 shapes exist for larger n; they are NOT complete and are
  never used as a census (they are used only as extra non-tiler test data).
