sizes with no non-tilers at all (no file published; every hole-free shape
  tiles): polyominoes n<=6, polyhexes n<=5, polyiamonds n<=6 and n=8.
format: alternating lines `x1 y1 x2 y2 ...` (heesch-sat grid coordinates,
  identical to heesch_verify.grids) and `Hc = a Hh = b`. Holed shapes are not
  listed (Kaplan excludes them), so within a listed size a hole-free shape
  absent from the list is a tiler.
